# ==============================================================================
# SnifferEngine — build context hygiene (vault plan 0002 — Stage 1.2)
# ==============================================================================
# Keeps the docker build context small and the image hermetic. These rules
# affect image builds only — docker-compose.yml bind mounts are untouched by
# them (files excluded here are still visible inside the container through
# the /workspace bind mount).
#
# The full worktrees/ exclusion is load-bearing: a checked-out worktree can
# contain complete repositories and build artifacts; shipping them into the
# context would slow every build.
# ==============================================================================

.git
target
worktrees
vault
docs
dist
scratch
.cargo
.cache
.extensions
.vscode
.idea
*.log
*_screenshot.png
